stributive Non-Modular Lattice</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc98242032b14823\" href=\"?note=fc98242032b14823\" title=\"93-df-distributive-lattice\">93-df-distributive-lattice</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ad379574ef6f3a71\" href=\"?note=ad379574ef6f3a71\" title=\"93-df-modular-lattice\">93-df-modular-lattice</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\mathbf{L}\\left(\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}(\\mathbf{L}) \\land \\neg\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathbf{L})\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\mathbf{L}\\left(\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}(\\mathbf{L}) \\land \\neg\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathbf{L})\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Distributivity implies modularity, so a genuinely distributive non-modular lattice cannot be used as an example.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"ex-distributive-nonmodular---No-Distributive-Non-Modular-Lattice","text":"ex-distributive-nonmodular - No Distributive Non-Modular Lattice","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"fc98242032b14823","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-distributive-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-modular-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"ad379574ef6f3a71","ancho